  "wechat_html": "<section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/3hAJnwuyZuicicZkgJBUCCaricdibomDBrTzXgUR7FJnf11qGIo8nmKt6RxibXrb5s4RFb9UZ9UOHQy7fqQyI377Licw/0?wx_fmt=gif\" style=\"width:100%;display:block;\"><section style=\"max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:2px;\"><section style=\"margin:12px 0 16px 0;padding:2px 2px 8px 2px;border-bottom:2px solid #1e293b;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#b59f7b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;font-weight:600;\">Global Briefing</div><h1 style=\"margin:0;font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;color:#0f172a;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">突发重磅！民调显示匈牙利蒂萨党有望在议会选举中获得三分之二多数…</h1></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;padding:0 2px 14px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;padding-left:10px;border-left:4px solid #b59f7b;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;color:#1e293b;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">民调显示匈牙利蒂萨党有望在议会选举中获得三分之二多数席位</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#334155;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-align:justify;\">据路透社援引Median最新民调预测，匈牙利反对党蒂萨党在议会选举中支持率大幅上升，有望获得三分之二的多数席位，这对现任总理欧尔班的执政地位构成挑战。</p><div style=\"margin-top:8px;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;padding-bottom:2px;\">Global Watch</span></div></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;padding:0 2px 14px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;padding-left:10px;border-left:4px solid #b59f7b;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;color:#1e293b;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">澳大利亚受勋老兵本·罗伯茨-史密斯因阿富汗战争罪指控继续被拘留</h2><section style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/79uC8IloHOAficOkWZuHOYwDO4pZ8YUwgypMqWiaS4FJE1BwuKVzy5TgKwh0hzKlrqDuoa97CeicibFLDtota98UmgmAsm8o2nxVibCJV6xPa5IE/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;media_id=6pMyx5iVnuzGNvPxaGYLsfeW8eCuC6c9unkLkW0hIMIOfHNokK7AMdw21aGfZy5C\" styl